msgstr "Fetch Room Data"

#: /src/turtegbot/index.js:35
#, icu-message-format, md-text
msgid "setting.entry.addon.turtegbot.global.fetchroom.description"
msgstr ""
"Determines whether to fetch the current room data from TurtegBot. This "
"ensures commands are sent with the correct prefix. If disabled, commands "
"will use the default (“#”) prefix, which may not always trigger the bot."

#: /src/turtegbot/index.js:24
