msgstr "Fetch User Data"

#: /src/turtegbot/index.js:24
#, icu-message-format, md-text
msgid "setting.entry.addon.turtegbot.global.fetchuser.description"
msgstr ""
"Determines whether to fetch your user data from TurtegBot. This enables "
"suggestions only for commands you have permission to use. If disabled, "
"commands will not be filtered by your permissions."